refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
boolstream_wrapper_restore stringprotocol
Restores a built-in wrapper previously unregistered with stream_wrapper_unregister. It also reverts a user-defined wrapper registered over a built-in name with stream_wrapper_register.

&reftitle.parameters;
protocol
The name of the built-in wrapper, without ://. It is case-sensitive.
